<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten pellets, meal unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten pellets, meal unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. corn gluten feed pellet and meal prices were steady Friday. The market continued to be propped up by good export demand, cash sources said.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -   98.00     98.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   95.00     95.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  340.00    340.00</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
